      "roughness": 1,
      "text": "CloudWatch Alarms (7)\n• ECS CPU > 70%  → scale-out\n• ECS CPU < 63%  → scale-in\n• 5xx errors > 10  → alert\n• ALB 5xx > 20  → alert\n• ECS CPU > 80%  → alert\n• ECS Memory > 85%  → alert\n• RDS connections > 50  → alert",
